       "reward_exp": 0,
       "description": "<i> The briefing room is lit by one lantern over the map table. The Commander does not sit. </i> <br> <br>\n\"Three of the Kage's letters left this village and came back as copies. Copies, not thefts. Someone wanted us blind, not angry. <br>\nThe paper traces to a private archive that keeps records for anyone who pays.\"",
